00:45:27.570 --> 00:45:30.000
Cream, huh? More cream.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:31.380
Very good, very good!

00:45:31.420 --> 00:45:32.850
Now we're going to make three.

00:45:32.890 --> 00:45:35.580
