00:45:35.620 --> 00:45:37.210
Besides, I don't drink a glass of water.

00:45:37.310 --> 00:45:38.210
I'm going to do a race.

00:45:38.310 --> 00:45:39.610
No doubt about it.

00:45:39.710 --> 00:45:41.080
I'm sure of that.

00:45:41.130 --> 00:45:43.730
Today is a party day and we shouldn't talk about work.

00:45:43.880 --> 00:45:46.380
