00:45:48.100 --> 00:45:50.930
I would like him to be a man so that he looks like you.

00:45:51.010 --> 00:45:53.080
Grumpy, but good.

00:45:53.180 --> 00:45:55.380
Very nice, and I don't want him to look like me.

00:45:55.500 --> 00:45:58.060
I don't want the boy to return it.

00:45:58.160 --> 00:45:59.860
Don't be offended, Mom.

