At least you can't deny that your position is very comfortable.

00:48:53.740 --> 00:48:57.340
Yes, but at the same time it's a position that, in any case, cannot last.

00:48:57.340 --> 00:49:00.000
- Margarita. - Since we were dating, I insisted on you...

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:02.180
