00:49:02.180 --> 00:49:04.780
Fine, but you mustn't forget that this house belongs to your parents.

00:49:04.780 --> 00:49:06.180
Don't get offended, mom.

00:49:06.180 --> 00:49:07.980
Before, everything seemed fine to me.

00:49:07.980 --> 00:49:10.780
That dad would look for a job and that dad would get out of this house.

00:49:10.780 --> 00:49:12.780
I didn't suspect that you would think all that.

00:49:12.780 --> 00:49:14.580
I have to think about it, mom.

00:49:14.580 --> 00:49:16.480
I want my son, when he opens his eyes,

00:49:16.480 --> 00:49:19.480
not to have his surroundings more than praises and comforts,

00:49:19.480 --> 00:49:21.480
gathered by the efforts of his parents.

00:49:21.480 --> 00:49:23.580
Margarita, you have moved me.

00:49:23.580 --> 00:49:25.770
Don Fermin, we'll move tomorrow.

00:49:25.770 --> 00:49:27.820
Yes, I didn't want to grieve him.

00:49:27.820 --> 00:49:30.000
I know from experience that life is a storm...

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.000
I don't want you to put me in front of you.

00:49:32.000 --> 00:49:34.000
I don't want you to put me in front of you.

00:49:34.000 --> 00:49:36.000
I'll leave you alone in the first round.

00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:38.000
I would say that Margarita is a bit disgusting.

00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:41.000
