00:49:58.540 --> 00:50:00.000
A little bit of tolerance.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:04.000
Do you think it's unbearable to have let you marry despite the fact that you didn't have a place to die?

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:06.000
And then, to settle in this house?

00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:08.000
- Well, all that doesn't matter. - For you?

00:50:08.000 --> 00:50:09.890
For me, it matters a lot.

00:50:09.890 --> 00:50:12.890
I was the lord and queen of my house, at least I wanted to do it.

00:50:12.890 --> 00:50:17.840
Now, to enter the bathroom, which is more than a bathroom, it looks like a collective, I have to queue.

00:50:17.840 --> 00:50:19.840
And when I enter, my goodness!

00:50:19.840 --> 00:50:21.700
That is a camp of gypsies.

00:50:21.700 --> 00:50:27.660
I find the machinita and the olive leaves, when I find them, in the least imaginable places.

00:50:27.660 --> 00:50:30.000
The brush is dirty with glue

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:33.940
because he uses it to set up those plans of the contests he takes part in.

00:50:34.340 --> 00:50:35.690
The bathroom exit?

00:50:35.890 --> 00:50:39.250
It serves as a mattress for the cat, which I already have here.

00:50:39.760 --> 00:50:43.160
Yesterday, in the back of the house, I discovered that the happy kitten

00:50:43.360 --> 00:50:45.160
