00:51:25.120 --> 00:51:30.000
It's useless to spend the day putting the visible signs that say "everything in its place"

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:31.730
And a place for everything.

00:51:31.990 --> 00:51:34.090
Underneath the letters in complicity with Raúl...

00:51:34.290 --> 00:51:36.530
...the boys write "Sócrates".

00:51:36.750 --> 00:51:38.610
Without thinking it's an offense to me.

00:51:38.920 --> 00:51:40.120
And to Sócrates.

00:51:40.500 --> 00:51:42.380
- Excuse me, ma'am. - What is it, Ramona?

00:51:42.580 --> 00:51:44.720
Where do I get the meat juice for Mr. Fermín?

00:51:44.920 --> 00:51:47.600
From the meat. You won't think of taking it out of a umbrella.

00:51:47.670 --> 00:51:49.050
Of course, Ramona, from the meat.

00:51:49.250 --> 00:51:52.590
But the buffet we had saved for that was given to the cat.

00:51:52.790 --> 00:51:55.000
- It's funny, isn't it? - Yes, very funny.

00:51:55.200 --> 00:51:57.480
- The opposites continue. - What do I do, then, sir?

00:51:57.680 --> 00:52:00.000
Give me an orange juice, as long as the cat doesn't eat it.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:01.600
- Good morning. - Good morning, sir.

00:52:01.800 --> 00:52:03.010
- Ramona. - Yes, sir?

00:52:03.190 --> 00:52:06.260
- Is there cyanide at home? - As far as I know, no.

00:52:06.510 --> 00:52:09.440
- Unless Javier is making it. - All right, go ahead.

00:52:11.870 --> 00:52:14.540
- What do you want the cyanide for? - Haven't you figured it out yet?

00:52:14.700 --> 00:52:16.300
You're so bad.

00:52:16.550 --> 00:52:19.990
- Don't be late. - The only department I plan to see is here, at Trescuaga.

00:52:20.180 --> 00:52:22.590
As long as nothing happens, the best thing is to be here.

00:52:22.870 --> 00:52:25.090
See you later. I'll be right back.

00:52:26.860 --> 00:52:28.670
