00:52:34.400 --> 00:52:37.620
...that a lot of what I say and do is for your own good.

00:52:37.620 --> 00:52:40.450
I don't know about that, Dad. You know I'm with you.

00:52:40.450 --> 00:52:43.450
- These indolences are dangerous. - And Margarita?

00:52:43.450 --> 00:52:45.450
In her room.

00:52:45.880 --> 00:52:54.840
- What a surprise! - Congratulations, darling!

00:52:54.840 --> 00:52:57.850
- When I came in, I met Raúl. - He couldn't keep the secret?

00:52:57.850 --> 00:53:00.000
My greatest joy would be that he looks like his father.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:04.170
- My father? Poor thing. - Hello, Eugenio. How are you?

00:53:04.370 --> 00:53:06.120
Preparing to travel to Paraguay.

00:53:06.520 --> 00:53:09.120
By the way, I think you fit me just right.

00:53:09.320 --> 00:53:10.630
- Me? - Yes, you.

00:53:10.740 --> 00:53:12.540
- Remember my car? - Yes, what do you have?

00:53:12.740 --> 00:53:14.340
I have it for sale for a bagatella.

00:53:14.540 --> 00:53:16.920
And I would give it to you as a friend as a gift.

00:53:17.120 --> 00:53:19.040
Well, as long as you are interested.

00:53:19.150 --> 00:53:22.640
- The idea is not bad. How much will you sell it to me? - Whatever you want.

00:53:22.840 --> 00:53:25.040
And what car are you driving, old man?

00:53:25.240 --> 00:53:27.970
But come on, let's have a coffee while we fix the matter.

00:53:28.170 --> 00:53:30.000
Where has Bernardo gone?

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:34.080
- Yes, business matters is all I know. - Business matters are men's business.

00:53:34.080 --> 00:53:38.930
- Hasn't anything happened between you two? - No, I thought I noticed some truths.

00:53:38.930 --> 00:53:44.840
Don't forget, daughter, that a woman ignores her husband, what she doesn't want to know.

00:53:44.840 --> 00:53:47.760
With Bernardo it's different, mom. His secrets are impenetrable.

00:53:47.760 --> 00:53:52.480
- How I envy you, Margarita. - Who understands women?

00:53:52.480 --> 00:53:55.400
Compare Bernardo's seriousness with Raul's madness.

00:53:55.400 --> 00:53:59.180
- Do you miss anything? - Without missing anything, I miss a lot.

00:53:59.180 --> 00:54:00.000
Don't you miss anything?

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:02.350
- I understand. - Maybe it's better that way, dad.

00:54:06.650 --> 00:54:09.340
- How soon, Raúl! - You convinced the owner!

00:54:09.340 --> 00:54:11.740
- How did it go? - Fantastic!

00:54:11.740 --> 00:54:14.540
- How many rooms do you have? - No, I didn't see the apartment.

00:54:14.540 --> 00:54:17.140
- And then? - It turns out that I found a colleague at the office,

00:54:17.140 --> 00:54:20.940
Rogerio, who is going to Paraguay and he sells me his car in a flea market.

00:54:20.940 --> 00:54:23.540
- A car? - It's a phenomenal car, model...

00:54:23.540 --> 00:54:25.630
Well, I don't know what model it is, but come on!

00:54:25.630 --> 00:54:30.000
- A car? If you don't know how to drive. - But do you think that everyone who drives knows?

00:54:30.160 --> 00:54:32.360
Where do you think you can get the money to pay us?

00:54:32.360 --> 00:54:34.960
That's the least of it. You always complicate your life.

00:54:34.960 --> 00:54:36.880
You have to think about the present.

00:54:36.880 --> 00:54:38.320
The future is...

00:54:38.320 --> 00:54:39.750
It's the future.

00:54:39.750 --> 00:54:41.750
There's a lot of smoke coming out of Javier's room.

00:54:41.750 --> 00:54:44.880
Or he's smoking or he's burning something, huh?

00:54:44.880 --> 00:54:46.770
The chemical compounds!

00:54:46.770 --> 00:54:48.770
These things must be handled very carefully.

00:54:48.770 --> 00:54:49.770
Follow me.

00:54:51.760 --> 00:54:53.360
...laurconauts.

00:54:53.360 --> 00:54:56.530
When I say that this is a case of manicomies...

00:54:56.530 --> 00:54:58.960
Yes, Fermín. I think you're right.

00:55:25.120 --> 00:55:28.040
I wrote the formula A with the B, and boom, explosion.

00:55:28.060 --> 00:55:30.000
I was in the right, my theory was right.

00:55:30.030 --> 00:55:32.790
Mixing the formula A with the B, blow. Explosion.

00:55:32.890 --> 00:55:34.970
Yes, again, don't mix it and drink it.

00:55:35.070 --> 00:55:37.670
It's a little fiddly, Javier, it's a little fiddly.

00:55:37.770 --> 00:55:40.110
But what about you? It seems there would have been a cataclysm here.

00:55:40.210 --> 00:55:42.170
There will be no danger of burning the house or...

00:55:42.270 --> 00:55:45.250
But Mr. Fermín still doesn't know that where I am, everything is fine.

00:55:49.670 --> 00:55:51.710
I arrived in my Argentina

00:55:51.810 --> 00:55:55.620
On a divine night of the 54th

00:55:56.260 --> 00:56:00.000
I walked the whole map like this sound of the wind

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:06.970
I saw my Argentina on a divine night of 54

00:56:06.970 --> 00:56:21.000
I walked all the map like this soil of the banana I found so pleasant

00:56:49.000 --> 00:56:52.340
The street runs, the street is empty

00:57:00.280 --> 00:57:05.680
The world is sad because here people only know how to love.

00:57:07.010 --> 00:57:12.010
I met in other lands women who were beautiful like a bouquet of roses.

00:57:13.010 --> 00:57:19.020
But here in my Argentina women are divine and affectionate.

00:57:20.020 --> 00:57:25.020
I met in other lands women who were beautiful like a bouquet of roses.

00:57:26.020 --> 00:57:30.000
But here in my Argentina women are divine

00:57:30.440 --> 00:57:32.440
cariñaza

00:57:32.440 --> 00:57:35.950
eeeh

00:57:35.950 --> 00:57:39.120
Todo el mundo se

00:57:39.120 --> 00:57:41.520
solo se siente

00:57:41.520 --> 00:57:43.320
en la calle corriente

00:57:43.320 --> 00:57:45.700
lo invita a soñar

00:57:45.700 --> 00:57:49.170
eeeh

00:57:49.170 --> 00:57:50.690
Todo el mundo se

00:57:50.690 --> 00:57:55.600
siente aquí

00:57:55.600 --> 00:57:57.080
la gente solo sabe

00:58:00.410 --> 00:58:04.090
What if we invite Paki and Bernardo and we all go to that common party?

00:58:04.090 --> 00:58:06.170
- No! - I'm afraid they're coming.

00:58:06.170 --> 00:58:10.010
- Haven't they come back yet? - Yes, but since we've come back, we'd rather not go out again.

00:58:10.010 --> 00:58:16.090
- Your lungs need air, to be alive. - I know, but to me, rabies affects my liver.

00:58:16.090 --> 00:58:18.650
Don't forget that we both have to be at Mr. Benavides' house.

00:58:18.650 --> 00:58:21.620
The manager of Raul's house? Are they going to see him because of the employment issue?

00:58:21.620 --> 00:58:24.020
What are you saying? What is that about employment?

00:58:24.020 --> 00:58:26.420
Always things have to escape Margarita.

00:58:26.420 --> 00:58:28.020
I wanted to give you a surprise.

00:58:28.020 --> 00:58:30.000
It seems that he starts working on Monday.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.900
- And what are you going to do with the studios? - I'm not going to abandon them.

00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:35.900
With what I earn, I'll pay for a specialized course.

00:58:36.000 --> 00:58:38.020
- What do you think, dad? - The idea is yours.

00:58:38.120 --> 00:58:40.840
But there are other ideas that dance in my head.

00:58:40.940 --> 00:58:45.030
Raúl, here I wrote down several directions of apartments that were rented.

00:58:45.130 --> 00:58:48.030
Every time I remember the apartments, I get in a bad mood.

00:58:48.130 --> 00:58:51.030
I never would have believed that they were so difficult to find.

00:58:51.130 --> 00:58:54.040
However, every day many are left unrented.

00:58:54.140 --> 00:58:57.040
In my office there is a boy who postponed his wedding five times...

00:58:57.140 --> 00:59:00.000
...for not having a place to get into when he got married.

00:59:00.640 --> 00:59:02.300
She didn't have a father, the girl.

00:59:02.660 --> 00:59:03.880
Don't be cruel, dad.

00:59:03.880 --> 00:59:06.020
I've accompanied Raul many times.

00:59:06.020 --> 00:59:07.860
And we found out about everything.

00:59:07.860 --> 00:59:10.540
Yesterday we went to a place where a man had died...

00:59:10.540 --> 00:59:12.060
...sure to arrive first.

00:59:12.060 --> 00:59:13.380
And do you know what happened to us?

00:59:13.380 --> 00:59:15.480
That with the dead inside, he was already rented...

00:59:15.480 --> 00:59:18.850
...the doctor who extended the certificate came ahead of us all.

00:59:18.850 --> 00:59:20.340
What do you tell me?

00:59:21.720 --> 00:59:23.140
Did you lift the table, ma'am?

00:59:23.140 --> 00:59:24.260
Go change.

00:59:24.260 --> 00:59:25.420
That's how it ends.

00:59:25.420 --> 00:59:26.510
Are you on a walk?

00:59:26.510 --> 00:59:29.350
No, I have to go see my sister, who is in the hospital.

00:59:29.350 --> 00:59:30.000
And where is she?

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:32.000
- Where do you live? - In Villa Devoto.

00:59:32.100 --> 00:59:34.100
Perfect! Don't worry, I'll take you there.

00:59:34.200 --> 00:59:37.530
Me, in a car? Thank you very much.

00:59:37.630 --> 00:59:41.530
- Do you think the car will do for so long? - Of course, it's wonderful.

00:59:41.630 --> 00:59:45.530
- Mom, are there any grapes? - No, only oranges and apples.

00:59:45.630 --> 00:59:48.530
What a pity. I wanted to eat grapes so much.

00:59:48.630 --> 00:59:51.530
This will be fixed soon. I'm going to look for them in the office right away.

00:59:51.630 --> 00:59:55.420
- No, don't bother yourself. - The two of us have to be in Benavides with grapes or without grapes.

00:59:55.520 --> 00:59:57.420
There will be grapes and we'll be in both.

00:59:57.520 --> 01:00:00.000
Did you eat, Gatito?

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:06.030
Well, it's the time when all the cats are sad, but it will also be fixed, huh?

01:00:06.030 --> 01:00:08.880
It has to do with the time with the cats.

01:00:08.880 --> 01:00:12.730
I think I've asked something, haven't I?

01:00:12.730 --> 01:00:14.970
Oh, I don't want to!

01:00:14.970 --> 01:00:17.140
But what's going on in this house?

01:00:17.140 --> 01:00:23.240
Could it be possible that you are not the exporter?

01:00:38.480 --> 01:00:40.340
But how could you crash if you didn't go even a meter?

01:00:40.340 --> 01:00:42.780
And I didn't realize, I left the car at speed and when I started...

01:00:42.780 --> 01:00:43.780
You started the tree.

01:00:43.780 --> 01:00:45.880
Now what do I think? The tree was in false squares.

01:00:45.880 --> 01:00:50.340
Yes, it would be convenient to ask the municipality to remove the trees from the neighborhood.

01:00:50.340 --> 01:00:54.120
- It's late, I'll leave you, Raúl. - No, but if it doesn't matter, look if it's right or wrong.

01:00:54.120 --> 01:00:55.620
I'll go with you.

01:00:55.620 --> 01:00:59.110
- It's not late that you're going to leave, see? - It's better that you drink the coffee.

01:00:59.110 --> 01:01:00.000
Hello, Paca.

01:01:00.410 --> 01:01:03.410
You missed the bus! You missed a great walk!

01:01:03.410 --> 01:01:05.230
- Are you here to eat? - No, thank you.

01:01:05.230 --> 01:01:08.180
Don't you feel well? Are you starting to get scared?

01:01:08.180 --> 01:01:10.180
- It's nothing, just a little cough. - Cough?

01:01:10.180 --> 01:01:12.180
- I'm vomiting, don't hit me! - Is that true?

01:01:12.180 --> 01:01:14.180
- No, dear. - Then something happened to Bernardo.

01:01:14.180 --> 01:01:17.180
- He's arrested. - What? Bernardo is arrested?

01:01:17.180 --> 01:01:21.190
- It can't be! - Well, woman, it's possible it's just a simple incident.

01:01:21.190 --> 01:01:23.190
He's had too much trust in his father.

01:01:23.190 --> 01:01:25.190
- Bernardo is a scoundrel. - It's impossible!

01:01:25.190 --> 01:01:27.190
There's something else in between.

01:01:27.190 --> 01:01:30.000
A woman who induced him to go to the grocery store without declaring it.

01:01:30.160 --> 01:01:36.010
- Bernardo contrabandista? It seems a dream. - And the most shameful thing is the use he has made of the money of others.

01:01:36.010 --> 01:01:41.010
- Is it the money from the mortgage? - Yes, dad. He did not pay the mortgage of this house.

01:01:41.010 --> 01:01:44.090
I have seen a letter he wrote to Fernandez asking for a month's extension.

01:01:44.090 --> 01:01:47.090
- Miserable. - It was a lot, Mr. Carmen.

01:01:47.090 --> 01:01:52.200
- Two hundred thousand pesos. - You too. How strange that you gave him money to pay.

01:01:52.200 --> 01:01:57.310
One week was missing for the victory. He asked me for the money to use it in the meantime in an operation.

01:01:57.310 --> 01:02:00.000
God knows what happened.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:03.680
- What a mess I'll be in. - You wanted to say that they are going to kill us?

01:02:03.680 --> 01:02:05.060
That and much more.

01:02:05.060 --> 01:02:07.920
I'm a solidary manager in all your affairs.

01:02:07.920 --> 01:02:09.320
Well, enough of the lamentations.

01:02:09.320 --> 01:02:12.620
The important thing is to do something for Bernardo and save the honor of the family.

01:02:12.620 --> 01:02:14.920
- Where did you say you were? - In the police department.

01:02:14.920 --> 01:02:16.920
- I'll see. - Nothing bad will happen to you.

01:02:16.920 --> 01:02:19.200
- Will they let you out? - Don't be afraid.

01:02:19.200 --> 01:02:22.650
- Mr. Raul, whenever you want, I'm ready. - For what?

01:02:22.650 --> 01:02:25.260
- Aren't you going to take me to the hospital? - Oh, we'll go out right away.

01:02:25.260 --> 01:02:27.260
Well, the car is as if such a thing.

01:02:27.260 --> 01:02:30.000
We only have 20 minutes to get to Bayanera. Let's go.

01:02:30.760 --> 01:02:32.960
Yes, first to Vellaneda and then to Villa de Boca.

01:02:32.960 --> 01:02:34.970
Are you going on another trip?

01:02:34.970 --> 01:02:37.570
- Do you have life insurance? - Don't run too much, Raúl.

01:02:37.570 --> 01:02:39.650
- Be careful, mom. Let's go? - Let's go.

01:02:39.650 --> 01:02:42.950
- Please, Raúl. - I'll be there.

01:02:42.950 --> 01:02:44.750
- Don Fermín! Don Fermín! - Yes, yes, yes.

01:02:44.750 --> 01:02:46.850
Why don't you buy the grapes for Margarita?

01:02:46.850 --> 01:02:48.350
- Who thinks that now? - I do.

01:02:48.350 --> 01:02:51.350
Let's see if La Cigüeña brings me a baby with a bunch on his head.

01:02:51.350 --> 01:02:52.460
I'll be there.

01:02:52.460 --> 01:02:55.260
Poor Raúl. He's in everything. He's an angel.

01:02:55.260 --> 01:02:56.390
Listen, Dad.

01:02:56.390 --> 01:03:00.000
What would happen if Margarita, instead of grapes, wanted a melon?

01:03:00.030 --> 01:03:07.640
- Marta, these are women's things. - And what am I, a man?

01:03:07.640 --> 01:03:12.160
- I mean the age. - Oh, it's been a few years since you brought me the seagulls.

01:03:12.160 --> 01:03:15.290
- Marta, to your room. - Oh, Mom!

01:03:15.290 --> 01:03:17.890
- I said to your room. - Okay.

01:03:19.900 --> 01:03:30.000
- Violence dominating the world. - What's wrong with you, Paca, that you haven't said a word in a while?

01:03:30.030 --> 01:03:33.030
- What do you want me to say? - Did you settle the mortgage matter?

01:03:33.030 --> 01:03:35.030
I assume there is nothing to do.

01:03:35.030 --> 01:03:38.880
The lender, as a good lender, has his eyes set on this house.

01:03:38.880 --> 01:03:40.880
- How painful is all this. - Yes.

01:03:40.880 --> 01:03:43.880
Sometimes I wonder why men will marry.

01:03:43.880 --> 01:03:46.880
In the street they hide nothing, not even the loved ones.

01:03:46.880 --> 01:03:48.700
And in the house, everything is gravity.

01:03:48.700 --> 01:03:51.700
Everything is a matter that we cannot understand, according to them.

01:03:51.700 --> 01:03:53.700
- You can't complain. - Neither can I.

01:03:53.700 --> 01:03:55.710
- Fermín is a saint. - I speak in general.

01:03:55.710 --> 01:03:57.710
- There are husbands in whom one can trust. - Yes.

01:03:57.710 --> 01:04:00.000
Yes, but if you don't trust me, I'll kill you.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:04.000
It's too much. We have to act continuously without them suspecting anything.

01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:06.000
That the husband likes football?

01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:08.890
Well, that the woman remembers that football drives him crazy.

01:04:08.890 --> 01:04:10.810
That he's a fan of the Bochas?

01:04:10.810 --> 01:04:12.810
Well, to the Bochas with him.

01:04:12.810 --> 01:04:14.810
That instead of a luxury hotel, he wants to eat in a cheap hotel?

01:04:14.810 --> 01:04:16.810
Well, to the Bodegón.

01:04:16.810 --> 01:04:20.810
Although the guys, when it's time to pay, have to look at the stains on the mantel to see what they've eaten.

01:04:20.810 --> 01:04:22.630
That's not how it is.

01:04:22.630 --> 01:04:24.630
Yes, as long as the husband is like Raul.

01:04:24.630 --> 01:04:26.640
How are you, Fermín?

01:04:26.640 --> 01:04:28.640
Awfully bad.

01:04:28.640 --> 01:04:30.000
He won't let Fernandez renew his contract.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.900
Fernandez is like Pérez, and Pérez is like Rodríguez.

01:04:32.900 --> 01:04:34.750
In adversity, people are known.

01:04:34.750 --> 01:04:36.630
This is like to die of anger.

01:04:36.630 --> 01:04:40.630
Well, I don't know how you drown in a glass of water knowing that Raúl is in the middle.

01:04:40.630 --> 01:04:43.630
But do you think that Raúl has a blind faith?

01:04:43.630 --> 01:04:47.940
As the luminous ideas of Raúl come into play, we are all fixed.

01:04:47.940 --> 01:04:52.510
Sir, two thugs ask where they put the TV.

01:04:52.510 --> 01:04:55.520
For what? It can't be. Who thinks now in televisions?

01:04:55.520 --> 01:04:57.520
Yes, dad, Raúl bought it.

01:04:57.520 --> 01:05:00.000
Go Ramona, tell them that I'll be right there.

01:05:00.380 --> 01:05:02.180
Are you sure, Margarita?

01:05:02.180 --> 01:05:04.200
And why do you want a TV, Raúl?

01:05:04.200 --> 01:05:05.320
To make the house happy?

01:05:05.320 --> 01:05:09.570
When I say that if we don't meet in jail, we'll do it in the asylum...

01:05:09.570 --> 01:05:11.840
And with what money have you made this purchase?

01:05:11.840 --> 01:05:14.300
And do you think it takes money to buy a TV?

01:05:14.300 --> 01:05:16.500
And shame, if one wants to pay it.

01:05:16.500 --> 01:05:18.700
Dad, today you are impossible.

01:05:18.700 --> 01:05:19.640
It's great.

01:05:19.640 --> 01:05:21.150
Tomorrow they will connect it.

01:05:21.150 --> 01:05:24.190
Leave this device and tell me, how was your first day of work?

01:05:24.190 --> 01:05:25.930
Great, the manager looks like you.

01:05:25.930 --> 01:05:27.150
Does he have the same figure?

01:05:27.150 --> 01:05:30.000
No, I mean he looks like you in character, a perfect...

01:05:30.030 --> 01:05:33.030
Everybody advised me to take good care of him and me.

01:05:33.030 --> 01:05:33.950
Oh, one thing.

01:05:33.950 --> 01:05:35.950
As soon as they found out I was Raul's brother-in-law,

01:05:35.950 --> 01:05:36.950
they caught my attention.

01:05:36.950 --> 01:05:38.960
And speaking of Raul, there's great news.

01:05:38.960 --> 01:05:39.960
What's going on?

01:05:39.960 --> 01:05:41.960
He's been appointed a double-debt and employment officer.

01:05:41.960 --> 01:05:42.960
Really?

01:05:42.960 --> 01:05:43.960
He told me that he works in aluminum.

01:05:43.960 --> 01:05:45.960
They're asking about the owner of the house.

01:05:45.960 --> 01:05:47.960
And for now, it's still me.

01:05:47.960 --> 01:05:50.320
Pre-made house company.

01:05:51.320 --> 01:05:54.310
Well, I'm here now so they can talk to me about pre-made houses.

01:05:54.310 --> 01:05:55.310
Tell them I'm not here.

01:05:55.310 --> 01:05:56.230
All right, sir.

01:05:56.230 --> 01:05:57.230
Why don't you receive him?

01:05:57.230 --> 01:05:58.180
You know he's coming.

01:05:58.180 --> 01:05:59.190
What do you want him to come to?

01:05:59.190 --> 01:06:00.000
What do you want me to do?

01:06:00.190 --> 01:06:03.080
He must be a juggler, or something like that.

01:06:03.080 --> 01:06:07.100
- Vultures running around the dam. - What's the dam, Dad?

01:06:07.100 --> 01:06:08.610
You're not going to know if it's raining.

01:06:08.610 --> 01:06:14.150
- Careful, I put them on new. - Oh, my God!

01:06:14.150 --> 01:06:17.280
- Well, enough! - Big guy.

01:06:17.280 --> 01:06:22.620
The man who gave me the card insists. He says he's sent by Mr. Raul.

01:06:22.620 --> 01:06:25.320
He's from Raul's department. You must have confidence.

01:06:25.320 --> 01:06:27.880
That's fine. Let him pass the desk.

01:06:27.880 --> 01:06:30.000
Maybe he wants to sell me a phonograph.

01:06:30.160 --> 01:06:32.400
And why do we need a phonograph when you're at home, huh?

01:06:34.500 --> 01:06:36.500
- Sit down. - Very nice.

01:06:36.580 --> 01:06:39.160
- Are you the owner of the house? - Servant.

01:06:39.240 --> 01:06:41.690
Thank you. Congratulations.

01:06:41.770 --> 01:06:43.550
Why didn't you want to welcome me?

01:06:43.590 --> 01:06:45.330
I need you to explain it to you.

01:06:45.410 --> 01:06:47.330
After living in this house for so many years...

01:06:47.410 --> 01:06:49.250
But you're wrong.

01:06:49.330 --> 01:06:51.250
The property will not suffer any alteration.

01:06:51.330 --> 01:06:53.250
In the empty land in the background...

01:06:53.330 --> 01:06:55.110
...we will build a modern apartment.

01:06:55.190 --> 01:06:57.120
You're going to build a piece of land in the basement?

01:06:57.200 --> 01:06:58.120
Yes, that's right.

01:06:58.200 --> 01:07:00.000
The property will not suffer any alteration.

01:07:00.030 --> 01:07:01.190
and with what authorization?

01:07:01.190 --> 01:07:02.480
With yours.

01:07:02.480 --> 01:07:04.100
I'm here to sign this document.

01:07:04.100 --> 01:07:05.800
But who sent you?

01:07:05.800 --> 01:07:07.300
Mr. Raul Sierra.

01:07:07.300 --> 01:07:08.600
Good morning!

01:07:08.600 --> 01:07:10.120
And how is it? What did you think of the idea?

01:07:10.120 --> 01:07:12.120
- Fantastic, right? - Sign me, sir.

01:07:12.120 --> 01:07:14.120
- Me? - You'll see it finished.

01:07:14.120 --> 01:07:17.020
Sign, sign, Dr. Nico Confianza, you know I'm in the middle.

01:07:17.020 --> 01:07:18.120
Just sign it.

01:07:18.120 --> 01:07:20.120
Well, I've already signed so many.

01:07:22.620 --> 01:07:25.730
It's been a pleasure.

01:07:25.730 --> 01:07:27.430
- Very good night. - Good night.

01:07:27.430 --> 01:07:28.930
- Good night. - Good night.

01:07:28.930 --> 01:07:29.510
Good night.

01:07:31.400 --> 01:07:34.200
- Is Margarita aware of this? - No, neither am I.

01:07:34.200 --> 01:07:37.490
Margarita!

01:07:37.490 --> 01:07:41.590
- What's going on, Raúl? - Come and take a look.

01:07:41.590 --> 01:07:44.590
- This is wonderful! - Where do you want to stay?

01:07:44.590 --> 01:07:47.590
- On the land we have unoccupied. - Are you going to build it?

01:07:47.590 --> 01:07:49.590
Sure, and with that the problem of the house is solved.

01:07:49.590 --> 01:07:51.600
We'll all live under the same roof.

01:07:51.600 --> 01:07:55.600
- But I want to leave a piece of... - Say no more. A piece of Alcornoque.

01:07:55.600 --> 01:08:00.000
- Yes, don't worry about us. - Where do you plan to get money to pay for the construction?

01:08:00.030 --> 01:08:01.830
Uh-huh. Another invention of yours.

01:08:01.830 --> 01:08:04.830
I'm the winner of a contest of prefabricated houses.

01:08:04.830 --> 01:08:06.830
- You won the prize? - Yes, brother.

01:08:07.830 --> 01:08:09.830
Javier and I spent three nights doing croquis.

01:08:09.830 --> 01:08:13.830
It was very difficult to fit three rooms, bathroom and kitchen in so little space.

01:08:13.830 --> 01:08:15.840
The Chinese paint that we would have spent.

01:08:15.840 --> 01:08:17.840
But it came out and you can see the result.

01:08:17.840 --> 01:08:20.840
The prize consists of the free construction of expenses of the ideal department.

01:08:20.840 --> 01:08:22.840
It means that we will not have to go looking for houses.

01:08:22.840 --> 01:08:25.840
Naturally. I did not abuse your trust, Mr. Fermin.

01:08:25.840 --> 01:08:27.840
Oh, what hope. But you forgot about the finish.

01:08:27.840 --> 01:08:30.000
Is it true? What hope?

01:08:30.220 --> 01:08:31.560
But what am I going to forget?

01:08:31.560 --> 01:08:35.260
I explained to these about the mortgage and it seems that he fell into grace.

01:08:35.260 --> 01:08:37.620
They raise the mortgage twenty years in the long run.

01:08:37.620 --> 01:08:39.940
These matters are resolved by moving zero permits.

01:08:39.940 --> 01:08:42.260
Ah, how good, Raúl.

01:08:43.860 --> 01:08:45.860
- Talk to him. - Talk to him.

01:08:45.860 --> 01:08:48.930
- Talk to him. - Talk to him.

01:08:48.930 --> 01:08:52.690
- You will say. - It's better to say Raúl.

01:08:52.690 --> 01:08:56.180
- You speak, Raúl. - There's Bernardo out there.

01:08:56.180 --> 01:08:59.130
Raúl got the trust of his bosses and is free.

01:08:59.130 --> 01:09:00.000
Just wait for your forgiveness.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:02.280
No, I've suffered a lot, I've been deceived!

01:09:02.280 --> 01:09:04.110
What would you do in my place?

01:09:04.110 --> 01:09:06.060
I would hang him!

01:09:06.060 --> 01:09:07.920
If a woman doesn't forgive, what's the point of being a woman?

01:09:07.920 --> 01:09:09.970
I don't know what would happen without you.

01:09:09.970 --> 01:09:11.970
I would go for life, suffocating.

01:09:11.970 --> 01:09:14.970
We would come to see him as a lost man, a criminal.

01:09:14.970 --> 01:09:16.970
Your conscience wouldn't be at peace.

01:09:16.970 --> 01:09:18.920
And nobody thinks about me.

01:09:18.920 --> 01:09:22.810
I don't know that you're right, but to make mistakes is human, and to forgive is divine.

01:09:22.810 --> 01:09:25.770
Javier has said it, to forgive is human and to make mistakes is divine.

01:09:25.770 --> 01:09:26.770
Oh God!

01:09:26.770 --> 01:09:30.000
As Javier said, forgiving is human and making mistakes is divine.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:33.200
They are loves and not good words, of flesh and bones.

01:09:33.300 --> 01:09:37.170
- Is the title of a movie? - Yes, of a movie that comes perfectly to the case.

01:09:37.200 --> 01:09:40.720
You have to remember Quinta Miró, a man who sees through the window...

01:09:40.820 --> 01:09:42.920
...all the insults that they give him in return.

01:09:43.020 --> 01:09:47.320
And they venerate him in the memory, and by whose cheeks two tears flow.

01:09:47.420 --> 01:09:51.330
Seeing her, who has not felt the impulse to get up from the audience and scream...

01:09:51.430 --> 01:09:54.130
...that the man was out there, suffering, but not being able to.

01:09:54.230 --> 01:09:57.330
And that only by forgiving him, the situation would have been fixed.

01:09:57.430 --> 01:10:00.000
That's what we want you to do with Bernardo.

01:10:00.030 --> 01:10:02.090
It's different. That man had children.

01:10:02.090 --> 01:10:03.800
You can have them too.

01:10:03.800 --> 01:10:06.080
Possibly that's the real mistake.

01:10:06.080 --> 01:10:08.700
If Bernardo were a father, it would be different.

01:10:08.700 --> 01:10:10.080
Give him a son, Paca.

01:10:10.080 --> 01:10:11.380
- Or two. - Or three.

01:10:11.380 --> 01:10:13.600
Or quintuplets. That's how they come out in all the newspapers.

01:10:13.600 --> 01:10:14.900
The better the better.

01:10:14.900 --> 01:10:17.100
If you knew how sure I feel about Raúl.

01:10:17.100 --> 01:10:21.160
Because I know that we will always be the two of us alone.

01:10:31.080 --> 01:10:39.640
- Really? - It's going to be later than ever, huh?

01:10:39.950 --> 01:10:42.070
- Where's Fermin? - He's in the bedroom.

01:10:42.190 --> 01:10:44.440
I want to talk to him right away. Let's go.

01:10:44.510 --> 01:10:47.710
I'm coming too. Maybe I have to defend him.

01:10:47.830 --> 01:10:49.630
And you know that if they let me talk...

01:10:49.750 --> 01:10:50.870
Crazy!

01:10:51.040 --> 01:10:53.040
- Ma'am. - What is it, Ramona?

01:10:53.160 --> 01:10:56.490
At the door there's a lady who's asking about Mr. Raul.

01:10:56.610 --> 01:10:58.370
And why so much mystery? What's wrong?

01:10:58.490 --> 01:11:00.000
He'll be a colleague at the office.

01:11:00.060 --> 01:11:01.810
- Sure. - Make him come in.

01:11:06.110 --> 01:11:07.980
- Good evening. - Good evening.

01:11:07.980 --> 01:11:11.440
- Do you work in Raul's office? - No, not that, miss.

01:11:11.440 --> 01:11:14.480
I'm here to be... Raul's fiancée.

01:11:14.480 --> 01:11:15.480
What?

01:11:15.480 --> 01:11:18.180
- Didn't you make a mistake at home? - No, miss, no.

01:11:18.180 --> 01:11:20.190
We've been here many times.

01:11:20.190 --> 01:11:23.360
Of course, you're surprised because he hasn't told you anything.

01:11:23.360 --> 01:11:25.360
- I asked him not to do it. - What?

01:11:25.360 --> 01:11:27.460
Until we formalized our relationship.

01:11:27.460 --> 01:11:29.700
I wasn't convinced of his seriousness.

01:11:30.320 --> 01:11:34.320
Last week he wanted to talk to my parents, but it seemed too soon and that's why he got angry.

01:11:34.320 --> 01:11:36.170
I did wrong in taking this step.

01:11:36.170 --> 01:11:38.250
What will you think of me?

01:11:38.250 --> 01:11:40.250
Think of you nothing, miss.

01:11:40.250 --> 01:11:44.170
As for what I think of my husband, I can't say.

01:11:44.170 --> 01:11:45.170
Your husband?

01:11:45.170 --> 01:11:48.350
I don't think your husband has anything to do with this matter.

01:11:48.350 --> 01:11:50.350
My husband is the Raul you're looking for.

01:11:50.350 --> 01:11:51.350
It can't be.

01:11:51.350 --> 01:11:53.360
He called me on the phone every moment.

01:11:53.360 --> 01:11:56.360
When he said goodbye, he always did it with a song.

01:11:56.360 --> 01:11:58.360
There is no doubt. It's him, it's him.

01:11:58.360 --> 01:12:00.000
And last week he gave me this present.

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:03.610
- It's him, it's him! - And you said you had lost him!

01:12:03.610 --> 01:12:06.610
- Asshole! - It's not my fault! I'm leaving!

01:12:06.610 --> 01:12:07.560
Now I'll explain everything!

01:12:07.560 --> 01:12:11.750
He's not human, he's made of flesh, he's blue beard!

01:12:11.750 --> 01:12:13.580
- Asshole! - Who would have said that?

01:12:13.580 --> 01:12:16.580
- But what's going on? - That all husbands are the same!

01:12:16.580 --> 01:12:18.580
Well, except mine.

01:12:18.580 --> 01:12:20.530
Although I'll have to ask for explanations.

01:12:20.530 --> 01:12:22.530
Because lately he's very cocky.

01:12:22.530 --> 01:12:24.530
That's it! I've decided, I'm breaking up with Raúl!

01:12:24.530 --> 01:12:26.540
- What are you saying? - What you've heard.

01:12:26.540 --> 01:12:30.000
You think it's easy to destroy things even if they look different?

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:34.780
- It wasn't easy, but you did it. - When you have a calm conscience you can face the whole world.

01:12:34.780 --> 01:12:38.830
But what's going on here? Am I right? There's nothing bigger than home life.

01:12:38.830 --> 01:12:43.410
- That's why I wanted to have two homes. - There's nothing comparable to domestic happiness, isn't there, Margarita?

01:12:43.410 --> 01:12:45.810
- Do you remember this handkerchief? - Oh, it appeared!

01:12:45.810 --> 01:12:48.290
- Where did you have it? - And what did you do to it? You didn't tell me!

01:12:48.290 --> 01:12:52.030
Go, husband!

01:12:53.850 --> 01:13:00.000
- Can you tell me what's going on? Why did Margarita hit you? - I don't know, it was a craving.

01:13:00.320 --> 01:13:02.260
You still have the audacity to make jokes.

01:13:02.280 --> 01:13:04.820
I'm making the jokes with myself. They owe me an explanation.

01:13:04.840 --> 01:13:07.120
Man, it's time we told you something.

01:13:07.140 --> 01:13:09.140
Aren't you ashamed to pretend to be single?

01:13:09.160 --> 01:13:11.580
But what's going on? It's the first time I think you're crazy.

01:13:11.600 --> 01:13:13.320
Mercedes, why don't you make things clear?

01:13:13.340 --> 01:13:15.680
A moment ago, a young lady came out of here,

01:13:15.700 --> 01:13:17.380
that Raúl was going to ask for in marriage.

01:13:19.220 --> 01:13:21.220
- You laugh! - Why? You have to laugh.

01:13:24.760 --> 01:13:27.700
- Where are you going? - Anywhere, where I don't see him anymore.

01:13:27.720 --> 01:13:30.000
- Margarita, is this your house? - Yes.

01:13:31.240 --> 01:13:35.770
- Who threw it? - This lady who says she was here a moment ago, insists on talking to you.

01:13:35.770 --> 01:13:38.560
Ah, that's good. Let's see how you defend yourself now.

01:13:38.560 --> 01:13:41.860
And be careful with wanting to accuse her of a disorder or something like that.

01:13:41.860 --> 01:13:44.480
Fermin, I would ask you not to speak.

01:13:44.480 --> 01:13:47.740
But when am I going to start sending this letter?

01:13:47.740 --> 01:13:53.750
Ma'am, I was just going to ask you to interfere with Raúl so he can return my letters.

01:13:53.750 --> 01:13:57.190
- Sometimes he writes nonsense. - The letter of the girl.

01:13:57.190 --> 01:14:00.000
- That's not Raúl. - So you got the wrong letter.

01:14:00.540 --> 01:14:05.980
No, ma'am. You are not Mr. Fermin, Mrs. Mercedes, Margarita.

01:14:05.980 --> 01:14:07.640
Yes, so it's here.

01:14:12.000 --> 01:14:15.220
- Elvira. - This is not Raúl. His name is Javier.

01:14:15.220 --> 01:14:16.560
And what do you tell me now?

01:14:16.560 --> 01:14:20.140
Forgive me for being ashamed and even fearing to give my true name.

01:14:20.140 --> 01:14:24.320
Mom, my girlfriend, do you like it?

01:14:24.320 --> 01:14:28.160
- Let's see what your father says. - Finally there is something that they let me think before I was born.

01:14:28.160 --> 01:14:30.000
And this handkerchief?

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:32.420
I took it from Raúl, but since Elvira liked it a lot, I gave it to him.

01:14:32.420 --> 01:14:35.480
Raúl, I gave you another one because of you!

01:14:35.480 --> 01:14:36.800
Forgive me.

01:14:36.800 --> 01:14:38.230
Errar is human.

01:14:38.230 --> 01:14:39.990
Forgive is divine.

01:14:39.990 --> 01:14:41.510
De carne somos.

01:14:41.510 --> 01:14:42.610
You shouldn't have forgiven me.

01:14:42.610 --> 01:14:44.460
Well, Raúl, I'm leaving.

01:14:44.460 --> 01:14:45.480
His name is Javier.

01:14:45.480 --> 01:14:46.520
It's true.

01:14:46.520 --> 01:14:48.020
What a beautiful name.

01:14:48.020 --> 01:14:49.090
I like it more.

01:14:49.090 --> 01:14:50.450
I won with the change.

01:14:50.450 --> 01:14:51.890
It's less vulgar.

01:14:51.890 --> 01:14:53.190
- Come on. - What do you say?

01:14:53.190 --> 01:14:55.090
Nothing. Besides, you're not leaving.

01:14:55.090 --> 01:14:59.540
We'll have something, all together, if we can have it in peace.

01:15:02.080 --> 01:15:04.820
- Another lady. - There's one in the yard.

01:15:04.820 --> 01:15:08.040
- What's there? - A bag that walks.

01:15:08.040 --> 01:15:11.040
It's nothing, it's a cat I brought to play with the cat.

01:15:11.040 --> 01:15:13.040
It's black and white. Come on, let's see it.

01:15:13.040 --> 01:15:15.040
Besides, I'm going to tell you something that I don't know what it is.

01:15:18.040 --> 01:15:20.470
- What did you think, Elvira? - Sympathetic.

01:15:20.470 --> 01:15:22.470
You know that if you oppose, there is nothing to do.

01:15:22.470 --> 01:15:25.470
Yes, I know that the one who sends you to this house is me.

01:15:25.470 --> 01:15:30.000
See, Fermín, they are happy. The joy returns.

01:15:30.030 --> 01:15:32.430
...the joy, the noise, the noise...

01:15:32.600 --> 01:15:36.610
...but is it possible that the children don't give more than headaches?

01:15:37.010 --> 01:15:43.720
One, two, one, two, one, two, one, two, one, two!

01:15:44.120 --> 01:15:46.720
What does this mean? Have you forgotten today?

01:15:46.920 --> 01:15:49.520
- I don't know, I don't remember. - It's possible, mom.

01:15:49.720 --> 01:15:51.720
Today is Mother's Day!

01:15:52.280 --> 01:15:55.800
You see, Fermín, then you say that the children don't give joy.

01:15:56.350 --> 01:16:00.000
- Mom! - Come here, mom, come here, come here.

01:16:00.160 --> 01:16:03.480
Mother. Mother. Mother.

01:16:03.560 --> 01:16:05.440
Mother. Mother. Mother.

01:16:05.520 --> 01:16:07.520
Mother. Mother. Mother.
